---
<section class="aw-world-explore aw-atlas-section" id="archive-index" aria-labelledby="aw-explore-title">
 <div class="aw-atlas-heading"><div><p class="aw-atlas-eyebrow">03 / ATLAS OF THE ARCHIVE</p><h2 id="aw-explore-title">夜の資料室、案内図。</h2><p>言葉を集める部屋。思想を結ぶ部屋。好きな入口からどうぞ。</p></div><img src="/brand/archive-seal.svg" alt="" width="84" height="84" loading="lazy"/></div>
 <div class="aw-atlas">
  <div class="aw-atlas-scene" aria-hidden="true"><picture><source media="(max-width:640px)" srcset="/brand/catalog-mobile.webp"/><img src="/brand/catalog-desktop.webp" width="1536" height="864" alt="" loading="lazy"/></picture></div>
  <svg class="aw-atlas-orbits" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 1200 630" preserveAspectRatio="none" fill="none">
   <g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><ellipse cx="600" cy="315" rx="515" ry="245" stroke-dasharray="2 7"/><ellipse cx="600" cy="315" rx="350" ry="268" stroke-opacity=".5"/><ellipse cx="600" cy="315" rx="190" ry="245"/><ellipse cx="600" cy="315" rx="176" ry="230" stroke-opacity=".5"/>
   <path d="M40 315H1160M600 22V608" stroke-opacity=".35" stroke-dasharray="3 7"/><path d="M600 315 255 105M600 315 255 315M600 315 255 525M600 315 945 105M600 315 945 315M600 315 945 525" stroke-opacity=".6"/>
   <path d="M32 72V32h42m1052 0h42v40M32 558v40h42m1052 0h42v-40" stroke-width="2"/></g>
   <g fill="currentColor"><path d="M600 40l5 12-5 12-5-12zM600 566l5 12-5 12-5-12zM82 315l12-5 12 5-12 5zM1094 315l12-5 12 5-12 5z"/><circle cx="255" cy="105" r="3"/><circle cx="255" cy="315" r="3"/><circle cx="255" cy="525" r="3"/><circle cx="945" cy="105" r="3"/><circle cx="945" cy="315" r="3"/><circle cx="945" cy="525" r="3"/></g>
  </svg>
  <nav class="aw-atlas-nav" aria-label="資料室の各部屋">
   <div class="aw-atlas-center">
    <div class="aw-atlas-center-art" aria-hidden="true"><img class="aw-atlas-annotator" src="/brand/sprites/annotator-standing.webp" width="370" height="1019" alt="" loading="lazy"/><img class="aw-atlas-rabbit" src="/brand/sprites/rabbit-reading.webp" width="357" height="317" alt="" loading="lazy"/></div>
    <div class="aw-atlas-central-caption"><small>01 / THE ANNOTATOR</small><strong>中央資料室</strong><span>世界には注釈を。自分には、まだ。</span></div>
    <a class="aw-atlas-cinema" href="#video-shelf"><span aria-hidden="true">▷</span><span><small>07 / SCREENING ROOM</small>映写室 · 動画から読む</span></a>
   </div>
   {rooms.map(room=><a class:list={['aw-atlas-room','aw-atlas-'+room.id]} href={room.href} data-room-link={room.id}>
    <span class="aw-atlas-object"><img src={'/brand/sprites/'+room.sprite+'.webp'} alt="" width={room.w} height={room.h} loading="lazy"/><span class="aw-atlas-object-ring" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
    <span class="aw-atlas-room-label"><small>{room.number} / {room.en}</small><strong>{room.ja}<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></strong><span>{room.task}</span></span>
   </a>)}
  </nav>
  <div class="aw-atlas-legend"><span>EX LIBRIS · A.W.</span><span>探索図 / 7つの入口</span></div>
 </div>
 <div class="aw-atlas-foot"><a href="/marginalia/">閉館後の編集記録 ↗</a><a href="/concepts/surplus-enjoyment/">コーラから余剰享楽を考える ↗</a><a href="/library/">すべての教材を検索 →</a></div>
</section>
